omx-dsp (0.12.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.12.1 (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: fdelay-sabotage generates its arm list in its scratch dir, not
    build/ (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * docs: point the oversampler and fdelay comments at omx-dsp's own oracles
    (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: the band-dynamics oracle at the nine RME rates
    (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: the oversampler arms the engine's omx_oversampler.test.c and
    halfband-kernel-probe.c held, at the RME rates (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: the fractional delay line's sabotage battery, moved from the
    engine's dsp-fdelay-sabotage.sh into make test (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: the fractional delay line's arms A-D from the engine's
    mix_fdelay.test.c, at the nine RME rates (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: the matched EQ design against its analogue prototypes from the
    engine's eq-matched-probe.c (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: the one-pole arms the engine's mix_onepole.test.c held, at the nine
    RME rates (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: the comp's in-band alias gate and the 4x round trip from the
    engine's oversample-probe.c (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)
  * test: the LFO arms the engine's mix_lfo.test.c held, at the nine RME
    rates (FreeMixer/openmixer#1603)

